<speak><prosody pitch="-0.59st" rate="1.03">Here&apos;s a warm and welcoming message for a new user joining a chat app: &quot;Hey there!</prosody><break time="520ms"/><break time="120ms"/><prosody pitch="1.00st" rate="1.03">Welcome to [Chat App Name]!</prosody><break time="520ms"/><prosody pitch="-0.12st" rate="1.03">We&apos;re thrilled to have you on board!</prosody><break time="520ms"/><prosody pitch="0.49st" rate="1.02">This is the perfect place to connect with like-minded people, share your thoughts, and make new friends.</prosody><break time="520ms"/><break time="120ms"/><prosody pitch="0.79st" rate="0.98">Don&apos;t worry if it takes a little time to get familiar with our community - we&apos;re here to help and support you every step of the way.</prosody><break time="520ms"/><break time="120ms"/><prosody pitch="0.43st" rate="1.01">Feel free to introduce yourself, ask questions, or just jump into a conversation that catches your eye.</prosody><break time="520ms"/><break time="120ms"/><prosody pitch="1.09st" rate="0.98">We can&apos;t wait to see what you have to share!</prosody><break time="520ms"/></speak>